<title>USA: Archer Daniels Midland names Andreas nephew CEO.</title>
<headline>Archer Daniels Midland names Andreas nephew CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co. said Thursday its board of directors named G. Allen Andreas chief executive officer, succeeding Dwayne Andreas, his uncle, in the post.</p>
<p>The agribusiness giant added that Dwayne Andreas will remain chairman of the board of directors.</p>
